If you are standing on the altar you can use : to check which
alignment it is. If you are standing next to one of the high priests
you can use ; to check their alignment. Neither of these actions takes
a turn. Additionally, if monsters start fleeing when you enter the
temple you are probably in the right place. If they don't, maybe you
are not.

